  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's US Flag Long Sleeve T-Shirt is crafted for those who want to proudly display their American spirit. Featuring a distressed US flag on the center chest and a small reverse flag graphic on the right sleeve, this graphic shirt is great for those who are proud to be an American. Made from a comfortable blend of 60% cotton / 40% polyester, the shirt ensures all-day comfort. The tag-less label enhances wearability by preventing irritation. This long sleeve design is perfect for cooler weather or layering.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133018",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's US Flag Long Sleeve T-Shirt is crafted for those who want to proudly display their American spirit. Featuring a distressed US flag on the center chest and a small reverse flag graphic on the right sleeve, this graphic shirt is great for those who are proud to be an American. Made from a comfortable blend of 60% cotton / 40% polyester, the shirt ensures all-day comfort. The tag-less label enhances wearability by preventing irritation. This long sleeve design is perfect for cooler weather or layering, offering versatility for various occasions. Whether worn casually or as a statement piece, this long sleeve shirt is a stylish and comfortable way to showcase your love for the USA.</p>",
